    "chunk_text": "\ufffde gelome mid \u00fey. Wi\u00fe hatum omum nim betonican & wermod & finul, gnid on eala & redic, sele him drincan. Wi\u00fe hatum omum nim fenompran & \u00fea smalan clatan, wyl on gate meolce & supe. Wi\u00fe hatum omum nim hunan & efelastan & alexandrian & betonican & cele\u00feonian & cerlices s\u00e6d, Sealf, nim ellenes blostman & \u00feone crop, wyl on buteran & smire mid. Gif hit wille wyrsman smire mid \u00e6ges geolcan, ofer smire mid \u00fey & drige to gledum o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hit Wi\u00fe hatum omum nim wines dr\u00e6stan, meng wi\u00fe hreaw \u00e6gru & mid fe\u00feere smit on & ne \u00feweah \u00e6r Wi\u00fe seondum omum nim cneowholen micle \u00e6r o\u00f0rum mete d\u00e6ghwam to \u00feam dolge & hry\u00feeres Do tosomne, lacna mid. Wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan, \u00fe\u00e6t is fic, lustmoce \u00fea croppihtan nim to ba\u00fee & geb\u00e6rne to sealfe wulfes ceacan Wi\u00fe banco\u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6t is oman, nim nigontyne sn\u00e6da eolonan & nygon ontran & endlefan reades Drenc wi\u00fe onfeallum, cymed, pipor, cost, merces s\u00e6d, ceaster wyrte s\u00e6d, cnua wel, do on eala. Drenc wi\u00fe onfeallum, cnua on eala o\u00fe\u00fee geseo\u00f0 cele\u00feonian & heahhiolo\u00fean, bisceopwyrt, gy\u00ferifan. Drenc wi\u00fe onfeallum, sigsonte, cipe, leac, wegbr\u00e6de nio\u00feoweard, wyl ealle on w\u00e6tre & geswet mid Drenc wi",
